0..78 Comment "//! Transport back along `ua`: the cubical case table of Cohen, Coquand, Huber"
79..156 Comment "//! and Mörtberg, _Cubical Type Theory: a constructive interpretation of the"
157..178 Comment "//! univalence axiom_"
179..270 Comment "//! [Cohen-2015-cubical_type_theory_a_constructive_interpretation_of_the_univalence_axiom],"
271..343 Comment "//! § 4.5, read at the universe. `Path.back(ua(e))` is the transport of"
344..427 Comment "//! `Path.here(a)` along `ua(e)` in `y. Path[.A = Type](y, a)`, and transport along"
